@startuml 12-website-lifecycle
!include ../../_style.iuml
title Website lifecycle (target)

state "Moderation status" as moderationStatus {
  [*] --> checking : POST /v1/websites\n(202 Accepted)
  checking --> published : SFW check: safe
  checking --> rejected : SFW check: unsafe
  checking --> checking : classifier error\n(queue retry, max 3 attempts)
  checking --> checking : held for manual review\n(review_flag: model_error | unreachable)
  published --> published : a report flags it for review\n(review_flag: reported; never hidden automatically)
  published --> rejected : manual reject after a report\n(review script)
  checking --> published : manual approve\n(review script)
  checking --> rejected : manual reject\n(review script)
  rejected --> [*] : purged after 30 days\n(url may be resubmitted)
}

state "Verification (only while published)" as verification {
  [*] --> unverified
  unverified --> verified : widget found\n(verify on request or cron)
  verified --> unverified : widget missing on\n2 consecutive cron checks
}

note right of moderationStatus
  Visibility
  • checking: only the submitter sees it (local draft)
  • published: public, listed
  • rejected: not listed; the submitter's draft
    shows the reason
end note

note right of verification
  Default list order ("Melhores"): rank_score from
  recent clicks, total clicks and verification (ADR 0004).
  Verified cards show the colourful icon.
end note

@enduml
